 obj:[["Talk about habits and daily routines.","التحدث عن العادات والروتين اليومي."],["Add -s / -es correctly with he, she, it.","إضافة s أو es بشكل صحيح مع he و she و it."],["Make negatives and questions with do / does.","تكوين النفي والسؤال باستخدام do و does."]],
 en:["We use the present simple for things we do again and again: habits, routines, and facts. It does not describe what is happening right now.","With I, you, we and they, the verb stays in its base form. With he, she and it, we add -s or -es: she wakes, he goes, it takes.","For negatives and questions we need a helper verb: do or does. After do or does, the main verb goes back to its base form, so we say \"Does he drive?\", not \"Does he drives?\".","Words like always, usually, often, sometimes and never come before the main verb, but after the verb to be."],
 ar:["نستخدم المضارع البسيط للأشياء المتكررة: العادات والروتين والحقائق الثابتة. وهو لا يصف ما يحدث الآن في هذه اللحظة.","مع I و you و we و they يبقى الفعل كما هو. ومع he و she و it نضيف s أو es: she wakes، he goes، it takes.","في النفي والسؤال نحتاج فعلًا مساعدًا: do أو does. وبعدهما يرجع الفعل الأساسي إلى صورته الأصلية بدون s، فنقول Does he drive وليس Does he drives.","كلمات مثل always و usually و often و sometimes و never تأتي قبل الفعل الأساسي، لكنها تأتي بعد فعل to be."],
 forms:[
 ["Affirmative","الإثبات","Subject + verb (+ s / es with he, she, it)","I wake up at six.","She wakes up at five."],
 ["Negative","النفي","Subject + don't / doesn't + base verb","I don't drink coffee.","He doesn't take the bus."],
 ["Question","السؤال","Do / Does + subject + base verb ?","Do you have breakfast at home?","Does the traffic bother you?"]
 ],
