 en:["Use the present simple for habits, routines and things that are always true: \"I usually play football on Fridays.\"","Use the present continuous for something happening now, or for a temporary situation around now: \"This Friday I'm staying at home.\"","Time words help you choose. Always, usually, often, sometimes, never and every day go with the present simple. Now, right now, at the moment, today, this week and this month go with the present continuous.","After like, love, enjoy and prefer, use verb + -ing to talk about activities: \"I enjoy cooking\", \"He doesn't like swimming\". These verbs describe feelings, so they stay in the present simple: say \"I love this book\", not \"I'm loving this book\"."],
 ar:["نستخدم المضارع البسيط للعادات والروتين والحقائق الدائمة: I usually play football on Fridays.","نستخدم المضارع المستمر لما يحدث الآن، أو لوضع مؤقت في الفترة الحالية: This Friday I'm staying at home.","كلمات الوقت تساعدك في الاختيار. always و usually و often و sometimes و never و every day تأتي مع المضارع البسيط. و now و right now و at the moment و today و this week و this month تأتي مع المضارع المستمر.","بعد like و love و enjoy و prefer نستخدم الفعل + ing للحديث عن الأنشطة: I enjoy cooking، He doesn't like swimming. وهذه أفعال شعور، فتبقى في المضارع البسيط: نقول I love this book وليس I'm loving this book."],
