 topic:["Past Simple: Questions and Negatives","الماضي البسيط: السؤال والنفي"], level:"A2",
 obj:[["Say what did not happen with didn't.","ذكر ما لم يحدث باستخدام didn't."],["Ask about the past with Did and question words.","السؤال عن الماضي باستخدام Did وأدوات الاستفهام."],["Keep the main verb in its base form after did.","إبقاء الفعل الأساسي في صورته الأصلية بعد did."]],
 en:["In the past simple, negatives and questions need the helper verb did. For the negative, use didn't + base verb: \"I didn't hear my alarm.\"","For a question, use Did + subject + base verb: \"Did you get to work on time?\" With a question word, put it first: \"What did your manager say?\", \"When did you get home?\"","The most important rule: did already shows the past, so the main verb goes back to its base form. Say \"I didn't go\" and \"Did you see?\", never \"I didn't went\" or \"Did you saw?\" This is true for regular and irregular verbs.","Short answers repeat did: \"Yes, I did\", \"No, I didn't\". The verb to be is different: it never takes did. Say \"I wasn't late\" and \"Were you late?\""],
 ar:["في الماضي البسيط يحتاج النفي والسؤال إلى الفعل المساعد did. للنفي نستخدم didn't + الفعل في صورته الأصلية: I didn't hear my alarm.","وللسؤال نستخدم Did + الفاعل + الفعل الأصلي: Did you get to work on time? ومع أداة الاستفهام نضعها أولًا: What did your manager say? و When did you get home?","أهم قاعدة: did تدل على الماضي بنفسها، ولذلك يرجع الفعل الأساسي إلى صورته الأصلية. نقول I didn't go و Did you see? ولا نقول أبدًا I didn't went أو Did you saw? وهذا مع الأفعال المنتظمة والشاذة معًا.","الإجابات القصيرة تكرر did: Yes, I did و No, I didn't. أما فعل to be فمختلف: لا يأخذ did أبدًا. نقول I wasn't late و Were you late?"],
 forms:[
 ["Affirmative","الإثبات","Subject + past form","I woke up late and missed the bus.","A colleague helped me."],
 ["Negative","النفي","Subject + didn't + base verb","I didn't hear my alarm this morning.","She didn't say anything."],
 ["Question","السؤال","(Question word) + did + subject + base verb ?","Did you get to work on time?","What did your manager say?"]
 ],
