 obj:[["Talk about a possible future situation and its result.","التحدث عن موقف محتمل في المستقبل ونتيجته."],["Use the present simple after if, and will in the result.","استخدام المضارع البسيط بعد if و will في النتيجة."],["Choose between if and when.","الاختيار بين if و when."]],
 en:["The first conditional talks about something that may happen in the future, and its result: \"If it rains tomorrow, we'll stay at home.\"","It has two parts. The if part uses the present simple. The result part uses will + base verb. Never put will after if: say \"If it rains\", not \"If it will rain\".","You can start with either part. When if comes first, write a comma after that part: \"If you leave now, you'll catch the train.\" When if is in the middle, there is no comma: \"You'll catch the train if you leave now.\"","Use if when something is only possible, and when if you are sure it will happen: \"When everyone arrives, we'll start.\" Unless means if not: \"We'll go unless it rains.\" The result can also be an instruction: \"If you have any questions, please ask me.\""],
 ar:["الجملة الشرطية الأولى تتحدث عن شيء قد يحدث في المستقبل وعن نتيجته: If it rains tomorrow, we'll stay at home.","لها جزآن. جزء if يكون في المضارع البسيط. وجزء النتيجة يكون بـ will + الفعل في صورته الأصلية. ولا نضع will بعد if أبدًا: نقول If it rains وليس If it will rain.","يمكن أن تبدأ بأي من الجزأين. إذا جاءت if أولًا نكتب فاصلة بعد جزئها: If you leave now, you'll catch the train. وإذا جاءت في الوسط فلا فاصلة: You'll catch the train if you leave now.","نستخدم if عندما يكون الأمر محتملًا فقط، و when عندما نكون متأكدين من حدوثه: When everyone arrives, we'll start. و unless معناها «إذا لم»: We'll go unless it rains. ويمكن أن تكون النتيجة تعليمات: If you have any questions, please ask me."],
 forms:[
 ["Affirmative","الإثبات","If + present simple, subject + will + base verb","If it rains tomorrow, we'll stay at home.","You'll feel better if you get some rest."],
 ["Negative","النفي","If + don't / doesn't + verb, … will  ·  If …, … won't + verb","If we don't hurry, we'll miss the flight.","If the price goes up, we won't buy it."],
 ["Question","السؤال","What will + subject + do if + present simple ?","What will you do if you lose your card?","Will your brother come if he finishes early?"]
