 g:{
 topic:["Review: Past, Present and Future","مراجعة: الماضي والحاضر والمستقبل"], level:"A2+",
 obj:[["Choose the right tense for the time you mean.","اختيار الزمن المناسب للوقت الذي تقصده."],["Move between past, present and future in one short talk.","الانتقال بين الماضي والحاضر والمستقبل في حديث قصير واحد."],["Introduce yourself fully and confidently.","تقديم نفسك تقديمًا كاملًا وبثقة."]],
 en:["You now have six tools for talking about time. Choosing the right one depends on when the action happens and how you see it.","The present: use the present simple for facts and habits (\"I work at a bank\"), and the present continuous for now and for temporary situations (\"I'm speaking more confidently\").","The past: use the past simple for finished actions at a known time (\"I started my career many years ago\"). Use the present perfect when the action connects to now: an experience, a result, or something that started in the past and is still true (\"I've worked in banking for fifteen years\").","The future: use be going to for plans you have already made (\"I'm going to start the B1 level\"), will for promises, decisions and predictions (\"I'll keep shadowing\"), and if + present with will for a possible result (\"If I practice every day, I'll reach my goal\")."],
 ar:["لديك الآن ست أدوات للتعبير عن الزمن. واختيار الأداة المناسبة يتوقف على وقت حدوث الفعل وعلى نظرتك إليه.","الحاضر: نستخدم المضارع البسيط للحقائق والعادات (I work at a bank)، والمضارع المستمر لما يحدث الآن وللأوضاع المؤقتة (I'm speaking more confidently).","الماضي: نستخدم الماضي البسيط للأفعال المنتهية في وقت معروف (I started my career many years ago). ونستخدم المضارع التام عندما يتصل الفعل بالحاضر: تجربة، أو نتيجة، أو شيء بدأ في الماضي وما زال قائمًا (I've worked in banking for fifteen years).","المستقبل: نستخدم be going to للخطط التي قرّرتها بالفعل (I'm going to start the B1 level)، و will للوعود والقرارات والتوقعات (I'll keep shadowing)، و if + مضارع مع will لنتيجة محتملة (If I practice every day, I'll reach my goal)."],
 forms:[
 ["Affirmative","الإثبات","Present: I work · I'm working  ·  Past: I worked · I've worked  ·  Future: I'm going to work · I'll work","I work as a product manager at a bank.","I've worked in banking for more than fifteen years."],
 ["Negative","النفي","I don't work · I'm not working · I didn't work · I haven't worked · I'm not going to work · I won't work","I still make mistakes, but I don't stop.","I didn't speak English at work before."],
 ["Question","السؤال","Do you … ? · Are you …ing? · Did you … ? · Have you … ? · Are you going to … ? · Will you … ?","Have you finished the whole course?","What are you going to do next?"]
 ],
