l1:{t:["Omar's Morning","صباح عمر"],p:[
["Omar is a bank employee, and he lives in Giza with his family.","عمر موظف بنك، ويسكن في الجيزة مع أسرته."],
["He wakes up at six o'clock every morning.","يستيقظ في السادسة كل صباح."],
["First, he turns off the alarm and takes a quick shower.","أولًا يطفئ المنبّه ويأخذ دُشًّا سريعًا."],
["Then he gets dressed and has breakfast with his wife and children.","ثم يرتدي ملابسه ويفطر مع زوجته وأولاده."],
["He usually has eggs and bread, but he doesn't drink coffee.","عادةً يتناول بيضًا وخبزًا، لكنه لا يشرب القهوة."],
["At seven thirty, the family leaves the house.","في السابعة والنصف تغادر الأسرة البيت."],
["Omar drives his kids to school, and then he goes to work.","يوصّل عمر أولاده إلى المدرسة ثم يذهب إلى العمل."],
["The traffic is often heavy, so he listens to English podcasts in the car.","الزحام شديد غالبًا، ولذلك يستمع إلى بودكاست إنجليزي في السيارة."],
["He arrives at the office at half past eight, ready for a new day.","يصل إلى المكتب في الثامنة والنصف مستعدًّا ليوم جديد."]],q:[
["What time does Omar wake up?",["At five","At six","At seven thirty","At half past eight"],1,"He wakes up at six o'clock every morning."],
["What doesn't he drink?",["Tea","Water","Coffee","Juice"],2,"he doesn't drink coffee."],
["Where does he go first after he leaves the house?",["To the office","To the gym","To the bank","To his kids' school"],3,"Omar drives his kids to school, and then he goes to work."],
["Why does he listen to podcasts in the car?",["The traffic is often heavy","He has no radio","His kids like them","His manager asks him to"],0,"The traffic is often heavy, so he listens to English podcasts."]]},
d02:{t:["A New Colleague","زميلة جديدة"],p:[
["Laila is a new accountant at a big company in Cairo.","ليلى محاسِبة جديدة في شركة كبيرة في القاهرة."],
["Today is her first day, and she is a little nervous.","اليوم يومها الأول، وهي متوترة قليلًا."],
["Her office is on the third floor, next to the meeting room.","مكتبها في الطابق الثالث، بجوار غرفة الاجتماعات."],
["Her manager is Mrs. Hala, and she is very kind.","مديرتها هي الأستاذة هالة، وهي طيبة جدًا."],
["The people in her department are friendly.","الناس في قسمها ودودون."],
["Adam is an engineer, and his desk is near the window.","آدم مهندس، ومكتبه قريب من النافذة."],
["He is from Cairo, but Laila is from Alexandria.","هو من القاهرة، لكن ليلى من الإسكندرية."],
["They are not in the same department, but they are on the same floor.","ليسا في القسم نفسه، لكنهما في الطابق نفسه."],
["At the end of the day, Laila is tired but happy.","في نهاية اليوم ليلى متعبة لكنها سعيدة."]],q:[
["What is Laila's job?",["She is an engineer","She is an accountant","She is a manager","She is a teacher"],1,"Laila is a new accountant."],
["Where is her office?",["On the first floor","Near the window","On the third floor","In Alexandria"],2,"Her office is on the third floor, next to the meeting room."],
["Where is Adam from?",["Cairo","Alexandria","Giza","Aswan"],0,"He is from Cairo."],
["How is Laila at the end of the day?",["Angry","Sad","Sick","Tired but happy"],3,"Laila is tired but happy."]]},
d03:{t:["Hassan's Family","أسرة حسن"],p:[
["Hassan has a big family, and he loves them very much.","حسن له أسرة كبيرة، ويحبهم كثيرًا."],
["His wife's name is Dina, and she is a teacher.","اسم زوجته دينا، وهي معلّمة."],
["They have two sons and a daughter.","لديهما ابنان وابنة."],
["Their older son, Ali, is fifteen, and his favorite subject is math.","ابنهما الأكبر علي عمره خمسة عشر عامًا، ومادته المفضلة الرياضيات."],
["Their daughter, Salma, is the youngest, and she has her mother's eyes.","ابنتهما سلمى هي الصغرى، ولها عينا أمها."],
["Hassan's parents live in a small village near Mansoura.","والدا حسن يعيشان في قرية صغيرة قرب المنصورة."],
["Their house has a big garden, and the children love it.","بيتهما فيه حديقة كبيرة، والأولاد يحبونها."],
["Every month, the family visits them, and Hassan's mother cooks for everyone.","كل شهر تزورهما الأسرة، وتطبخ أم حسن للجميع."],
["For Hassan, family is the most important thing in his life.","الأسرة عند حسن أهم شيء في حياته."]],q:[
["What is Dina's job?",["A doctor","A teacher","An accountant","A nurse"],1,"she is a teacher."],
["How old is Ali?",["Eleven","Thirteen","Fifteen","Seventeen"],2,"Their older son, Ali, is fifteen."],
["Whose eyes does Salma have?",["Her mother's","Her father's","Her brother's","Her grandmother's"],0,"she has her mother's eyes."],
["Where do Hassan's parents live?",["In Cairo","In Dubai","In Alexandria","In a small village near Mansoura"],3,"Hassan's parents live in a small village near Mansoura."]]},
d04:{t:["Rania's New Apartment","شقة رانيا الجديدة"],p:[
["Rania's new apartment is on the fourth floor of a modern building.","شقة رانيا الجديدة في الطابق الرابع من مبنى عصري."],
["There are two elevators, so she doesn't use the stairs.","يوجد مصعدان، ولذلك لا تستخدم السلّم."],
["There are three bedrooms and two bathrooms.","توجد ثلاث غرف نوم وحمّامان."],
["In the living room, there is a large balcony with a view of the park.","في غرفة المعيشة توجد شرفة واسعة تطل على الحديقة."],
["The kitchen is small, but there is an oven and a lot of light.","المطبخ صغير، لكن يوجد فيه فرن وضوء كثير."],
["There isn't a fridge yet, so Rania needs to buy one.","لا توجد ثلاجة بعد، ولذلك تحتاج رانيا أن تشتري واحدة."],
["There aren't any pictures on the walls, but she has many ideas.","لا توجد صور على الحوائط، لكن لديها أفكار كثيرة."],
["Near the building, there are two schools and a hospital.","قرب المبنى توجد مدرستان ومستشفى."],
["There is also a garage under the building for her car.","ويوجد أيضًا جراج تحت المبنى لسيارتها."]],q:[
["Which floor is the apartment on?",["The second","The third","The fourth","The fifth"],2,"on the fourth floor of a modern building."],
["What is missing in the kitchen?",["A fridge","An oven","A table","Light"],0,"There isn't a fridge yet."],
["What is near the building?",["A bank and a park","Two schools and a hospital","A supermarket","A train station"],1,"there are two schools and a hospital."],
["Where is the garage?",["Next to the park","Across the street","Behind the hospital","Under the building"],3,"There is also a garage under the building."]]},
d05:{t:["The Weekly Shopping","تسوّق الأسبوع"],p:[
["Every Friday, Amal goes to the supermarket to buy food for the week.","كل جمعة تذهب أمل إلى السوبر ماركت لشراء طعام الأسبوع."],
["This week she doesn't have much time, so she makes a list.","هذا الأسبوع ليس لديها وقت كثير، ولذلك تكتب قائمة."],
["She needs some rice, some vegetables and a bottle of olive oil.","تحتاج بعض الأرز وبعض الخضراوات وزجاجة زيت زيتون."],
["There isn't any milk at home, so she buys two bottles.","لا يوجد أي حليب في البيت، ولذلك تشتري زجاجتين."],
["She wants some fresh fish, but the shop doesn't have any today.","تريد بعض السمك الطازج، لكن المحل ليس لديه أي سمك اليوم."],
["She buys two kilos of chicken instead.","فتشتري كيلوين من الدجاج بدلًا منه."],
["She takes two boxes of eggs, because her children eat a lot of eggs.","تأخذ علبتين من البيض، لأن أولادها يأكلون بيضًا كثيرًا."],
["She doesn't buy many sweets, because too much sugar is bad for the kids.","لا تشتري حلوى كثيرة، لأن السكر الزائد مضرّ بالأولاد."],
["At the cash desk, she pays by card and asks for two bags.","عند الخزينة تدفع بالبطاقة وتطلب كيسين."]],q:[
["When does Amal go shopping?",["Every day","Every Friday","Every Saturday","Once a month"],1,"Every Friday, Amal goes to the supermarket."],
["Why does she make a list?",["She forgets things","Her husband asks her","She doesn't have much time","The shop is big"],2,"she doesn't have much time, so she makes a list."],
["What does she buy instead of fish?",["Chicken","Meat","Eggs","Cheese"],0,"She buys two kilos of chicken instead."],
["Why doesn't she buy many sweets?",["They are expensive","The shop has none","She doesn't like them","Too much sugar is bad for the kids"],3,"too much sugar is bad for the kids."]]},
