["What is the marketing team doing?",["Answering phones","Having lunch","Writing emails","Designing posters"],3,"The marketing team is designing posters for a new product."]]},
d07:{t:["A Different Week","أسبوع مختلف"],p:[
["Youssef loves sports, and he usually plays football every Friday.","يوسف يحب الرياضة، وعادةً يلعب كرة القدم كل جمعة."],
["He also goes to the gym three times a week.","ويذهب أيضًا إلى الصالة الرياضية ثلاث مرات في الأسبوع."],
["But this week is different, because his knee hurts.","لكن هذا الأسبوع مختلف، لأن ركبته تؤلمه."],
["He isn't playing football, and he isn't going to the gym.","هو لا يلعب كرة القدم، ولا يذهب إلى الصالة الرياضية."],
["Instead, he is resting at home and reading a book about history.","بدلًا من ذلك يستريح في البيت ويقرأ كتابًا عن التاريخ."],
["His wife enjoys painting, and she goes to a class every Saturday.","زوجته تستمتع بالرسم، وتذهب إلى حصة كل سبت."],
["Their children are learning to swim this month.","أولادهما يتعلمون السباحة هذا الشهر."],
["In the evening, the family usually watches a movie together.","في المساء تشاهد الأسرة فيلمًا معًا عادةً."],
["Tonight they are watching an old comedy, and everyone is laughing.","الليلة يشاهدون فيلمًا كوميديًا قديمًا، والجميع يضحك."]],q:[
["What does Youssef usually do on Fridays?",["He goes swimming","He plays football","He paints","He reads"],1,"he usually plays football every Friday."],
["Why is this week different?",["He is traveling","He has a lot of work","His knee hurts","It is a holiday"],2,"this week is different, because his knee hurts."],
["What is he reading?",["A book about history","A sports magazine","A novel","The news"],0,"reading a book about history."],
["What are the children doing this month?",["Playing football","Painting","Watching movies","Learning to swim"],3,"Their children are learning to swim this month."]]},
d08:{t:["Dinner for Two","عشاء لشخصين"],p:[
["Khaled and his wife are at a restaurant by the Nile.","خالد وزوجته في مطعم على النيل."],
["They have a reservation for two, and the waiter gives them a table by the window.","لديهما حجز لشخصين، ويعطيهما النادل طاولة بجوار النافذة."],
["\"Would you like something to drink?\" the waiter asks.","يسأل النادل: «هل تودّان شيئًا للشرب؟»"],
["Khaled would like a lemon juice, and his wife would like water.","خالد يودّ عصير ليمون، وزوجته تودّ ماءً."],
["To start, they would like two lentil soups.","في البداية يودّان طبقين من حساء العدس."],
["For the main course, Khaled orders grilled fish with rice.","للطبق الرئيسي يطلب خالد سمكًا مشويًا مع الأرز."],
["His wife would like chicken pasta, because she doesn't like spicy food.","زوجته تودّ مكرونة بالدجاج، لأنها لا تحب الطعام الحار."],
["The food is delicious, and they are too full for dessert.","الطعام لذيذ، وهما أشبع من أن يتناولا الحلوى."],
["At the end, Khaled asks for the check and leaves a good tip.","في النهاية يطلب خالد الحساب ويترك بقشيشًا جيدًا."]],q:[
["Where is their table?",["Near the door","By the window","In the garden","Next to the kitchen"],1,"the waiter gives them a table by the window."],
["What would Khaled like to drink?",["Water","Coffee","Lemon juice","Orange juice"],2,"Khaled would like a lemon juice."],
["Why does his wife order chicken pasta?",["She doesn't like spicy food","It is cheap","She doesn't eat fish","The waiter suggests it"],0,"because she doesn't like spicy food."],
["Do they have dessert?",["Yes, ice cream","Yes, cake","Yes, fruit","No, they are too full"],3,"they are too full for dessert."]]},
d09:{t:["Two Jackets","سترتان"],p:[
["Omar needs a formal jacket for an important meeting.","عمر يحتاج سترة رسمية لاجتماع مهم."],
["In the shop, he finds two jackets: a gray one and a black one.","في المحل يجد سترتين: واحدة رمادية وواحدة سوداء."],
["The gray jacket is lighter and cheaper than the black one.","السترة الرمادية أخف وأرخص من السوداء."],
["But the black jacket is warmer, and its quality is better.","لكن السترة السوداء أدفأ، وجودتها أفضل."],
["Omar tries on the black jacket, but it is smaller than his old one.","يجرّب عمر السترة السوداء، لكنها أصغر من سترته القديمة."],
["The assistant brings a bigger size, and it is more comfortable.","يحضر البائع مقاسًا أكبر، وهو أكثر راحة."],
["The black jacket is two hundred pounds more expensive.","السترة السوداء أغلى بمئتي جنيه."],
["Prices are lower during the sale, but the sale is next week.","الأسعار أقل في التخفيضات، لكن التخفيضات الأسبوع القادم."],
["Omar can't wait, so he buys the black jacket. It is the better choice.","عمر لا يستطيع الانتظار، فيشتري السترة السوداء. إنها الاختيار الأفضل."]],q:[
["Why does Omar need a jacket?",["For a wedding","For an important meeting","For a trip","For the winter"],1,"a formal jacket for an important meeting."],
["Which jacket is cheaper?",["The black one","They are the same","The gray one","The blue one"],2,"The gray jacket is lighter and cheaper."],
["Why does he need a bigger size?",["The jacket is smaller than his old one","He likes loose clothes","It is for his brother","The color is wrong"],0,"it is smaller than his old one."],
["Why doesn't he wait for the sale?",["He doesn't like sales","The shop will close","The sale is only for shoes","The sale is next week, and he can't wait"],3,"the sale is next week. Omar can't wait."]]},
d10:{t:["A Day in Cairo","يوم في القاهرة"],p:[
["Cairo is the biggest city in Egypt, and it is one of the oldest cities in the world.","القاهرة أكبر مدينة في مصر، وهي من أقدم مدن العالم."],
["For visitors, the pyramids are the most famous place to see.","الأهرامات عند الزوار أشهر مكان للزيارة."],
["The best time to visit them is early morning, because it is the coolest time of the day.","أفضل وقت لزيارتها الصباح الباكر، لأنه ألطف وقت في اليوم."],
["Midday is the hottest and the most crowded time.","منتصف النهار أشد الأوقات حرارة وأكثرها ازدحامًا."],
["The cheapest way to travel in the city is the metro.","أرخص طريقة للتنقل في المدينة هي المترو."],
["A taxi is the easiest way, but it is the most expensive.","التاكسي أسهل طريقة، لكنه الأغلى."],
["The Egyptian Museum is the most interesting place for people who love history.","المتحف المصري أمتع مكان لمن يحبون التاريخ."],
["In the evening, the best view of the Nile is from the bridges.","في المساء أفضل إطلالة على النيل من فوق الجسور."],
["Many people say that Cairo at night is the most beautiful city in the world.","يقول كثيرون إن القاهرة ليلًا أجمل مدينة في العالم."]],q:[
["What is the most famous place for visitors?",["The Nile","The pyramids","The metro","The bridges"],1,"the pyramids are the most famous place to see."],
["When is the best time to visit the pyramids?",["Midday","In the evening","Early morning","At night"],2,"The best time to visit them is early morning."],
["What is the cheapest way to travel in the city?",["The metro","A taxi","A bus","Walking"],0,"The cheapest way to travel in the city is the metro."],
["Where is the best view of the Nile in the evening?",["From the museum","From a taxi","From the pyramids","From the bridges"],3,"the best view of the Nile is from the bridges."]]},
d11:{t:["How to Find Our Branch","كيف تصل إلى فرعنا"],p:[
["Our branch is easy to find from the metro station.","الوصول إلى فرعنا سهل من محطة المترو."],
["Leave the station and turn right.","اخرج من المحطة وانعطف يمينًا."],
["Go straight ahead for two blocks.","امشِ إلى الأمام مباشرةً لمربعين."],
["Walk past the pharmacy and the bakery.","تجاوز الصيدلية والمخبز."],
["At the traffic lights, cross the road and turn left.","عند إشارة المرور اعبر الطريق وانعطف يسارًا."],
["Don't take the first street. Take the second street on the right.","لا تأخذ الشارع الأول. خذ الشارع الثاني على اليمين."],
["The branch is opposite the park, between a café and a bookshop.","الفرع مقابل الحديقة، بين مقهى ومكتبة."],
["The entrance is on the corner, and there is a blue sign above the door.","المدخل على الناصية، وتوجد لافتة زرقاء فوق الباب."],
["If you come by car, park behind the building. Don't park in front of the entrance.","إذا جئت بالسيارة فاركن خلف المبنى. لا تركن أمام المدخل."]],q:[
["What do you do first when you leave the station?",["Turn left","Turn right","Cross the road","Go straight"],1,"Leave the station and turn right."],
["What do you walk past?",["A school and a mosque","A bank and a hotel","The pharmacy and the bakery","The park"],2,"Walk past the pharmacy and the bakery."],
["Where is the branch?",["Opposite the park","Next to the station","Behind the bakery","In the square"],0,"The branch is opposite the park, between a café and a bookshop."],
["Where should you park?",["In front of the entrance","In the park","On the corner","Behind the building"],3,"park behind the building."]]},
d12:{t:["The Doctor's Advice","نصيحة الطبيبة"],p:[
["Tarek doesn't feel well, so he goes to the doctor.","طارق لا يشعر أنه بخير، فيذهب إلى الطبيبة."],
["He has a bad cough, a headache and a fever.","عنده سعال شديد وصداع وحمّى."],
["The doctor checks his temperature and says it is just a cold.","تقيس الطبيبة حرارته وتقول إنها مجرد نزلة برد."],
["\"You shouldn't worry,\" she says, \"but you should rest.\"","تقول: «لا ينبغي أن تقلق، لكن يجب أن تستريح.»"],
["He should take two tablets a day, after meals.","يجب أن يأخذ قرصين في اليوم بعد الأكل."],
["He should drink plenty of water and eat light food.","يجب أن يشرب ماءً كثيرًا ويأكل طعامًا خفيفًا."],
["He shouldn't go to work tomorrow, and he shouldn't sleep late at night.","لا ينبغي أن يذهب إلى العمل غدًا، ولا أن يسهر ليلًا."],
["Tarek asks, \"Should I come back?\"","يسأل طارق: «هل ينبغي أن أعود؟»"],
["The doctor says he should come back if he doesn't feel better in three days.","تقول الطبيبة إنه يجب أن يعود إذا لم يتحسن خلال ثلاثة أيام."]],q:[
["What is wrong with Tarek?",["A stomach pain","A cough, a headache and a fever","A broken leg","A toothache"],1,"He has a bad cough, a headache and a fever."],
["What does the doctor say it is?",["The flu","Something serious","Just a cold","An allergy"],2,"it is just a cold."],
["How many tablets should he take?",["Two a day","One a day","Three a day","Four a day"],0,"He should take two tablets a day."],
["Should he go to work tomorrow?",["Yes, in the morning","Yes, for two hours","Yes, if he feels better","No, he shouldn't"],3,"He shouldn't go to work tomorrow."]]},
d13:{t:["A Wedding in Alexandria","زفاف في الإسكندرية"],p:[
["Last Thursday, Dina was in Alexandria for her cousin's wedding.","يوم الخميس الماضي كانت دينا في الإسكندرية لحضور زفاف ابنة عمّها."],
["The wedding was in a big hotel near the sea.","كان الزفاف في فندق كبير قرب البحر."],
["There were three hundred guests, and the room was full.","كان هناك ثلاثمئة ضيف، وكانت القاعة ممتلئة."],
["The weather was cold and windy, but everyone was warm inside.","كان الطقس باردًا وعاصفًا، لكن الجميع كانوا في دفء بالداخل."],
["The food was excellent, and the music was wonderful.","كان الطعام ممتازًا، والموسيقى رائعة."],
["Dina's parents were there, and they were very happy.","كان والدا دينا هناك، وكانا سعيدين جدًا."],
["Her brother wasn't there, because he was at work in Dubai.","لم يكن أخوها هناك، لأنه كان في عمله في دبي."],
["The traffic was terrible after the party, so Dina was late.","كان المرور فظيعًا بعد الحفل، فتأخرت دينا."],
["She was tired the next morning, but it was a wonderful evening.","كانت متعبة في الصباح التالي، لكنها كانت أمسية رائعة."]],q:[
["Where was the wedding?",["In a garden","In a big hotel near the sea","At home","In a club in Cairo"],1,"The wedding was in a big hotel near the sea."],
["How many guests were there?",["One hundred","Two hundred","Three hundred","Five hundred"],2,"There were three hundred guests."],
["What was the weather like?",["Cold and windy","Hot and sunny","Warm and rainy","Nice and calm"],0,"The weather was cold and windy."],
["Why wasn't Dina's brother there?",["He was sick","He was late","He was angry","He was at work in Dubai"],3,"he was at work in Dubai."]]},
d14:{t:["A Quiet Weekend","عطلة هادئة"],p:[
["Last weekend, Hala stayed at home.","في العطلة الماضية بقيت هالة في البيت."],
["On Friday morning, she cleaned the whole apartment and washed the windows.","صباح الجمعة نظّفت الشقة كلها وغسلت النوافذ."],
["In the afternoon, her sister called, and they talked for an hour.","بعد الظهر اتصلت أختها، وتحدثتا لمدة ساعة."],
["Then Hala cooked dinner and watched an old movie.","ثم طبخت هالة العشاء وشاهدت فيلمًا قديمًا."],
["On Saturday, she invited some friends for lunch.","يوم السبت دعت بعض الأصدقاء على الغداء."],
["They played cards and laughed a lot.","لعبوا الورق وضحكوا كثيرًا."],
["In the evening, she walked to the café and ordered a coffee.","في المساء مشت إلى المقهى وطلبت قهوة."],
["She opened her book and enjoyed the quiet.","فتحت كتابها واستمتعت بالهدوء."],
["She returned home at nine and decided to sleep early.","عادت إلى البيت في التاسعة وقررت أن تنام مبكرًا."]],q:[
["What did Hala do on Friday morning?",["She visited her sister","She cleaned the apartment","She went shopping","She worked"],1,"she cleaned the whole apartment and washed the windows."],
["How long did she talk to her sister?",["Ten minutes","Half an hour","An hour","Two hours"],2,"they talked for an hour."],
["Who did she invite on Saturday?",["Some friends","Her parents","Her colleagues","Her neighbors"],0,"she invited some friends for lunch."],
["What time did she return home?",["At six","At seven","At eight","At nine"],3,"She returned home at nine."]]},
d15:{t:["Our Trip to Alexandria","رحلتنا إلى الإسكندرية"],p:[
["Last month, Karim's family went to Alexandria by train.","الشهر الماضي ذهبت أسرة كريم إلى الإسكندرية بالقطار."],
["They left Cairo early, and the trip took about three hours.","غادروا القاهرة مبكرًا، واستغرقت الرحلة حوالي ثلاث ساعات."],
["They got a hotel room with a sea view.","حصلوا على غرفة فندق تطل على البحر."],
["On the first day, they saw the famous library and ate fish by the sea.","في اليوم الأول رأوا المكتبة الشهيرة وأكلوا سمكًا بجوار البحر."],
["Karim's son swam in the sea, and his daughter made a big sandcastle.","سبح ابن كريم في البحر، وصنعت ابنته قلعة رملية كبيرة."],
["Karim met an old friend, and they spoke for hours in a café.","قابل كريم صديقًا قديمًا، وتحدثا لساعات في مقهى."],
["His wife took hundreds of photos and bought gifts for her parents.","التقطت زوجته مئات الصور واشترت هدايا لوالديها."],
["They spent two nights in the city and came back on Sunday.","قضوا ليلتين في المدينة وعادوا يوم الأحد."],
["Everyone said it was the best trip of the year.","قال الجميع إنها أفضل رحلة في السنة."]],q:[
["How did they travel?",["By car","By train","By bus","By plane"],1,"went to Alexandria by train."],
["What did they see on the first day?",["The pyramids","A museum","The famous library","A castle"],2,"they saw the famous library."],
["Who did Karim meet?",["An old friend","His manager","His cousin","A client"],0,"Karim met an old friend."],
["How long did they stay?",["One night","A week","Three nights","Two nights"],3,"They spent two nights in the city."]]},
d16:{t:["Adel's Terrible Day","يوم عادل الفظيع"],p:[
["Yesterday was a terrible day for Adel.","كان أمس يومًا فظيعًا لعادل."],
["He didn't hear his alarm, so he woke up late.","لم يسمع المنبّه، فاستيقظ متأخرًا."],
["He missed the company bus and took a taxi.","فاته أتوبيس الشركة وأخذ تاكسي."],
["The driver didn't know the way, and Adel couldn't use his phone because he didn't charge it.","لم يعرف السائق الطريق، ولم يستطع عادل استخدام هاتفه لأنه لم يشحنه."],
["He arrived at ten o'clock, and he didn't have his laptop charger.","وصل في العاشرة، ولم يكن معه شاحن حاسوبه."],
["He borrowed one, but then the system crashed.","استعار واحدًا، لكن النظام تعطّل بعدها."],
["He waited for an hour and didn't finish his report.","انتظر ساعة ولم يُنهِ تقريره."],
["Did his manager get angry? No, she didn't. She gave him one more day.","هل غضبت مديرته؟ لا. أعطته يومًا إضافيًا."],
["Adel didn't eat lunch, but at home his wife made his favorite dinner.","لم يتغدَّ عادل، لكن زوجته أعدّت له في البيت عشاءه المفضل."]],q:[
["Why did Adel wake up late?",["He was sick","He didn't hear his alarm","He slept at four","His phone was off"],1,"He didn't hear his alarm, so he woke up late."],
["Why couldn't he use his phone?",["He lost it","It was broken","He didn't charge it","He left it at home"],2,"because he didn't charge it."],
["Did he finish his report?",["No, he didn't","Yes, in the morning","Yes, at home","Yes, with a colleague"],0,"didn't finish his report."],
["What did his manager do?",["She got angry","She wrote the report","She sent him home","She gave him one more day"],3,"She gave him one more day."]]},
d17:{t:["The Night the Lights Went Out","ليلة انقطاع الكهرباء"],p:[
["Last night, a storm hit the city at nine o'clock.","الليلة الماضية ضربت عاصفة المدينة في التاسعة."],
["Mona was working on her laptop when the lights went out.","كانت منى تعمل على حاسوبها عندما انقطعت الأنوار."],
["Her children were playing video games, and her husband was cooking.","كان أولادها يلعبون ألعاب الفيديو، وزوجها يطبخ."],
["It was raining heavily, and the wind was blowing.","كانت تمطر بغزارة، والرياح تهبّ."],
["Luckily, Mona was saving her file every few minutes, so she didn't lose her work.","لحسن الحظ كانت منى تحفظ ملفها كل بضع دقائق، فلم تفقد عملها."],
["While they were waiting, the family lit some candles.","بينما كانوا ينتظرون، أشعلت الأسرة بعض الشموع."],
["The children were telling stories and laughing.","كان الأولاد يحكون الحكايات ويضحكون."],
["Outside, people were standing in the dark street.","في الخارج كان الناس واقفين في الشارع المظلم."],
["Two hours later, the power came back while they were eating dinner.","بعد ساعتين عادت الكهرباء وهم يتناولون العشاء."]],q:[
["What was Mona doing when the lights went out?",["Cooking","Working on her laptop","Sleeping","Watching TV"],1,"Mona was working on her laptop when the lights went out."],
["Why didn't she lose her work?",["Her laptop was new","The power came back fast","She was saving her file every few minutes","She wasn't working"],2,"Mona was saving her file every few minutes."],
["What did the family do while they were waiting?",["They lit some candles","They went out","They slept","They called the police"],0,"the family lit some candles."],
["When did the power come back?",["After ten minutes","After one hour","The next morning","Two hours later"],3,"Two hours later, the power came back."]]},
d18:{t:["Summer Plans","خطط الصيف"],p:[
["Hossam and his family are going to take a week off in August.","حسام وأسرته سيأخذون أسبوعًا إجازة في أغسطس."],
["They are going to fly to Sharm El-Sheikh and stay in a small hotel by the beach.","سيسافرون بالطائرة إلى شرم الشيخ ويقيمون في فندق صغير على الشاطئ."],
["Hossam is going to book the tickets tonight.","حسام سيحجز التذاكر الليلة."],
["His wife is going to pack light clothes and sunscreen, because it is going to be very hot.","زوجته ستحزم ملابس خفيفة وواقي شمس، لأن الجو سيكون حارًا جدًا."],
["The children are going to learn to dive.","الأولاد سيتعلمون الغوص."],
["They aren't going to rent a car. They are going to use the hotel bus.","لن يستأجروا سيارة. سيستخدمون أتوبيس الفندق."],
["Hossam isn't going to check his work email on holiday.","حسام لن يتفقّد بريد العمل في الإجازة."],
["His colleague Laila is going to cover his work.","زميلته ليلى ستغطي عمله."],
["She isn't going to travel this year, because she is going to paint her apartment.","هي لن تسافر هذا العام، لأنها ستدهن شقتها."]],q:[
["Where are they going to fly?",["To Dubai","To Sharm El-Sheikh","To Alexandria","To Aswan"],1,"They are going to fly to Sharm El-Sheikh."],
["What are the children going to do?",["Play football","Learn to swim","Learn to dive","Stay at home"],2,"The children are going to learn to dive."],
["Are they going to rent a car?",["No, they are going to use the hotel bus","Yes, a small one","Yes, for two days","No, they are going to walk"],0,"They aren't going to rent a car."],
["What is Laila going to do this year?",["Travel abroad","Buy a car","Move to a new city","Paint her apartment"],3,"she is going to paint her apartment."]]},
d19:{t:["A Busy Week Ahead","أسبوع مزدحم قادم"],p:[
["Sherif has a busy week, and he has made many promises.","شريف أمامه أسبوع مزدحم، وقد قطع وعودًا كثيرة."],
["He will send the monthly report to his manager before four o'clock today.","سيرسل التقرير الشهري إلى مديرته قبل الرابعة اليوم."],
["Tonight he will finish the slides for the client.","الليلة سينهي الشرائح الخاصة بالعميل."],
["Tomorrow morning he will email them to the team.","صباح الغد سيرسلها بالبريد إلى الفريق."],
["Mona will check the numbers with him, so he won't need extra help.","منى ستراجع الأرقام معه، فلن يحتاج مساعدة إضافية."],
["On Thursday, the director will join the meeting.","يوم الخميس سينضم المدير إلى الاجتماع."],
["He won't have time to read everything, so Sherif will prepare a one-page summary.","لن يكون لديه وقت لقراءة كل شيء، ولذلك سيجهّز شريف ملخصًا من صفحة واحدة."],
["Sherif thinks the client will sign the contract this week.","يظن شريف أن العميل سيوقّع العقد هذا الأسبوع."],
["\"Don't worry,\" he tells his manager. \"I won't be late with anything.\"","يقول لمديرته: «لا تقلقي. لن أتأخر في أي شيء.»"]],q:[
["When will he send the monthly report?",["Tomorrow morning","Before four o'clock today","On Thursday","Next week"],1,"before four o'clock today."],
["Who will check the numbers with him?",["The director","The client","Mona","His manager"],2,"Mona will check the numbers with him."],
["What will Sherif prepare for the director?",["A one-page summary","A long report","New slides","A contract"],0,"Sherif will prepare a one-page summary."],
["What does Sherif think the client will do?",["Cancel the meeting","Ask for a discount","Call the director","Sign the contract this week"],3,"the client will sign the contract this week."]]},
l2:{t:["Applying for a Home Loan","التقدم بطلب قرض سكني"],p:[
["Mr. Adel would like to buy an apartment in a new compound.","الأستاذ عادل يودّ شراء شقة في كمبوند جديد."],
["The apartment costs three million pounds, and he can pay twenty percent as a down payment.","سعر الشقة ثلاثة ملايين جنيه، ويستطيع دفع عشرين بالمئة كمقدّم."],
["He visits the bank and asks, \"Could you tell me about your mortgage?\"","يزور البنك ويسأل: «هل يمكنك أن تخبرني عن التمويل العقاري لديكم؟»"],
["The officer explains that he can repay the loan over fifteen years.","يشرح الموظف أنه يستطيع سداد التمويل على خمس عشرة سنة."],
["He has to bring his ID, a salary certificate and six months of bank statements.","عليه إحضار بطاقته وشهادة مرتب وكشف حساب عن ستة أشهر."],
["He also has to bring a copy of the property contract.","وعليه أيضًا إحضار صورة من عقد العقار."],
["He doesn't have to bring the original contract today.","ليس عليه إحضار أصل العقد اليوم."],
["\"Can I send the documents by email?\" he asks.","يسأل: «هل يمكنني إرسال المستندات بالبريد الإلكتروني؟»"],
["\"Yes, you can,\" says the officer, \"but you have to sign the application at the branch.\"","يقول الموظف: «نعم، يمكنك، لكن عليك توقيع الطلب في الفرع.»"]],q:[
["How much does the apartment cost?",["One million pounds","Three million pounds","Six hundred thousand pounds","Fifteen million pounds"],1,"The apartment costs three million pounds."],
["How much can he pay as a down payment?",["Ten percent","Fifteen percent","Twenty percent","Fifty percent"],2,"he can pay twenty percent as a down payment."],
["Over how many years can he repay the loan?",["Fifteen","Six","Twenty","Thirty"],0,"he can repay the loan over fifteen years."],
["Where does he have to sign the application?",["At home","By email","At the compound","At the branch"],3,"you have to sign the application at the branch."]]},
d21:{t:["First Day Rules","قواعد اليوم الأول"],p:[
["Yara is starting a new job at a bank today.","يارا تبدأ اليوم وظيفة جديدة في بنك."],
["Mr. Magdy from HR explains the rules.","الأستاذ مجدي من الموارد البشرية يشرح القواعد."],
["She must wear her ID card all day, and she must sign in before eight thirty.","يجب أن ترتدي بطاقتها طوال اليوم، وأن تسجّل حضورها قبل الثامنة والنصف."],
["She doesn't have to wear a uniform, but she must dress formally.","ليس عليها ارتداء زي موحد، لكن يجب أن ترتدي ملابس رسمية."],
["She mustn't use her phone in front of customers.","ممنوع أن تستخدم هاتفها أمام العملاء."],
["Customer files are important: she mustn't take them home.","ملفات العملاء مهمة: ممنوع أن تأخذها إلى البيت."],
["She must lock them away every evening.","يجب أن تقفلها في مكانها كل مساء."],
["She has to change her password every month, and she mustn't share it.","عليها تغيير كلمة المرور كل شهر، وممنوع أن تشاركها."],
["She doesn't have to work on Saturdays, so she is happy.","ليس عليها العمل أيام السبت، ولذلك هي سعيدة."]],q:[
["When must she sign in?",["Before eight","Before eight thirty","Before nine","At any time"],1,"she must sign in before eight thirty."],
["Does she have to wear a uniform?",["Yes, every day","Yes, on Thursdays","No, but she must dress formally","No, she can wear anything"],2,"She doesn't have to wear a uniform, but she must dress formally."],
["What mustn't she take home?",["Customer files","Her ID card","Her laptop","Her phone"],0,"she mustn't take them home."],
["Does she have to work on Saturdays?",["Yes, always","Yes, in the morning","Yes, once a month","No, she doesn't have to"],3,"She doesn't have to work on Saturdays."]]},
d22:{t:["A Phone Message","رسالة هاتفية"],p:[
["Mr. Nabil calls the bank because he wants to speak to Mrs. Hala.","يتصل الأستاذ نبيل بالبنك لأنه يريد التحدث إلى الأستاذة هالة."],
["The receptionist tries to put him through to her, but she doesn't answer.","تحاول موظفة الاستقبال تحويله إليها، لكنها لا تردّ."],
["So he leaves a message for her.","فيترك لها رسالة."],
["He asks the receptionist to tell her about his loan documents.","يطلب من موظفة الاستقبال أن تخبرها عن مستندات القرض."],
["He sent them to her on Sunday, and he wants her to check them.","أرسلها لها يوم الأحد، ويريدها أن تراجعها."],
["He gives the receptionist his number, and she writes it down.","يعطي موظفة الاستقبال رقمه، فتدوّنه."],
["He also asks her to email him the list of fees.","ويطلب منها أيضًا أن ترسل له قائمة الرسوم بالبريد."],
["She sends it to him immediately.","فترسلها له فورًا."],
["Later, Mrs. Hala gets the message and calls him back.","لاحقًا تستلم الأستاذة هالة الرسالة وتعاود الاتصال به."]],q:[
["Who does Mr. Nabil want to speak to?",["The receptionist","Mrs. Hala","The manager","Mr. Sami"],1,"he wants to speak to Mrs. Hala."],
["What did he send on Sunday?",["An email","His number","His loan documents","The list of fees"],2,"his loan documents. He sent them to her on Sunday."],
["What does the receptionist email him?",["The list of fees","The contract","Her number","A message"],0,"email him the list of fees."],
["What does Mrs. Hala do later?",["She sends an email","She goes home","She forgets","She calls him back"],3,"Mrs. Hala gets the message and calls him back."]]},
d23:{t:["A Good Employee","موظف مجتهد"],p:[
["Tamer is a new officer at the bank, and he works very hard.","تامر موظف جديد في البنك، ويعمل بجدّ كبير."],
["He speaks politely to customers and explains every product clearly.","يتحدث بأدب مع العملاء ويشرح كل منتج بوضوح."],
["He answers emails quickly, and he learns fast.","يردّ على البريد بسرعة، ويتعلم بسرعة."],
["At first, he filled in the forms too fast and made some mistakes.","في البداية كان يملأ الاستمارات بسرعة زائدة فارتكب بعض الأخطاء."],
["His manager asked him to check every form carefully.","طلبت منه مديرته أن يراجع كل استمارة بعناية."],
["Now he works more slowly on the forms, and he does them correctly.","الآن يعمل على الاستمارات ببطء أكثر، وينجزها بشكل صحيح."],
["His colleague Mona helped him patiently in his first week.","زميلته منى ساعدته بصبر في أسبوعه الأول."],
["They work well together, and last month they finished a big report successfully.","يعملان معًا بشكل جيد، وفي الشهر الماضي أنهيا تقريرًا كبيرًا بنجاح."],
["His manager is happy, because the team is doing well.","مديرته سعيدة، لأن الفريق يؤدي جيدًا."]],q:[
["How does Tamer speak to customers?",["Quickly","Politely","Loudly","Slowly"],1,"He speaks politely to customers."],
["What was his problem at first?",["He arrived late","He didn't answer emails","He filled in the forms too fast","He didn't like the job"],2,"he filled in the forms too fast and made some mistakes."],
["Who helped him in his first week?",["Mona","His manager","A customer","Nobody"],0,"His colleague Mona helped him patiently."],
["What did they finish last month?",["A training course","A new system","A sales plan","A big report"],3,"they finished a big report successfully."]]},
d24:{t:["Planning the Trip","التخطيط للرحلة"],p:[
["Ola and Hady want to go to Ain Sokhna on Friday.","علا وهادي يريدان الذهاب إلى العين السخنة يوم الجمعة."],
["If the weather is good, they will leave at six in the morning.","إذا كان الطقس جيدًا، سيتحركان في السادسة صباحًا."],
["If they leave early, they will avoid the traffic.","إذا تحركا مبكرًا، سيتجنبان الزحام."],
["If it rains, they will go on Saturday instead.","إذا أمطرت، سيذهبان يوم السبت بدلًا منه."],
["Hady's brother will join them if he finishes work on time.","أخو هادي سينضم إليهما إذا أنهى عمله في الموعد."],
["If he doesn't finish, he will follow them by bus.","إذا لم ينتهِ، سيلحق بهما بالأتوبيس."],
["If Ola books the beach club today, she will get a discount.","إذا حجزت علا نادي الشاطئ اليوم، ستحصل على خصم."],
["If they cancel before Thursday, the club will give them their money back.","إذا ألغيا قبل الخميس، سيعيد النادي لهما مالهما."],
["The children will be happy if they can swim all day.","سيسعد الأولاد إذا استطاعوا السباحة طوال اليوم."]],q:[
["When will they leave if the weather is good?",["At five","At six","At eight","At noon"],1,"they will leave at six in the morning."],
["What will they do if it rains?",["Stay at home","Go to the cinema","Go on Saturday instead","Cancel the trip"],2,"If it rains, they will go on Saturday instead."],
["What will Ola get if she books today?",["A discount","A free meal","A better room","Her money back"],0,"If Ola books the beach club today, she will get a discount."],
["When will Hady's brother join them?",["If the weather is good","If he gets a discount","If the children are happy","If he finishes work on time"],3,"if he finishes work on time."]]},
d25:{t:["A Traveler and a Dreamer","مسافر وحالمة"],p:[
["Sherif loves traveling, and he has visited many places.","شريف يحب السفر، وقد زار أماكن كثيرة."],
["He has been to Jordan and Turkey, and he has flown many times.","ذهب إلى الأردن وتركيا، وسافر بالطائرة مرات كثيرة."],
["He has ridden a camel in the desert, and he has eaten food from many countries.","ركب جملًا في الصحراء، وأكل طعامًا من بلاد كثيرة."],
["But he has never been to Siwa.","لكنه لم يذهب إلى سيوة قط."],
["His colleague Rana is different: she has never traveled abroad.","زميلته رنا مختلفة: لم تسافر إلى الخارج قط."],
["She has spent all her holidays in Egypt.","قضت كل إجازاتها في مصر."],
["She has been to Siwa three times, and she has slept in the desert.","ذهبت إلى سيوة ثلاث مرات، ونامت في الصحراء."],
["She has seen the temples in Luxor many times, but she has never seen Abu Simbel.","رأت معابد الأقصر مرات كثيرة، لكنها لم ترَ أبو سمبل قط."],
["They have both decided to try something new next year.","وقد قرّر الاثنان تجربة شيء جديد العام القادم."]],q:[
["Which countries has Sherif been to?",["Italy and Spain","Jordan and Turkey","Dubai and Qatar","None"],1,"He has been to Jordan and Turkey."],
["Has Sherif ever been to Siwa?",["Yes, once","Yes, three times","No, never","Yes, many times"],2,"he has never been to Siwa."],
["How many times has Rana been to Siwa?",["Three times","Once","Twice","Never"],0,"She has been to Siwa three times."],
["What has Rana never seen?",["The temples in Luxor","The desert","Siwa","Abu Simbel"],3,"she has never seen Abu Simbel."]]},
d26:{t:["Good News on Monday","أخبار سارة يوم الاثنين"],p:[
["It is Monday morning, and Omar has good news for his manager.","صباح الاثنين، وعمر لديه أخبار سارة لمديرته."],
["The client has just signed the contract.","وقّع العميل العقد للتوّ."],
["Omar has already sent a copy to the legal team, and they have confirmed it.","أرسل عمر نسخة إلى الفريق القانوني بالفعل، وقد أكّدوا استلامها."],
["The sales team has already reached ninety percent of its target.","وصل فريق المبيعات بالفعل إلى تسعين بالمئة من مستهدفه."],
["The month hasn't ended yet, so they can still do more.","الشهر لم ينتهِ بعد، فما زال بإمكانهم تحقيق المزيد."],
["The system team has completed the first part of the update, but they haven't tested it yet.","أكمل فريق النظام الجزء الأول من التحديث، لكنهم لم يختبروه بعد."],
["Mona has just come back from her holiday.","عادت منى من إجازتها للتوّ."],
["The designer has already finished the new brochure.","أنهى المصمم الكتيّب الجديد بالفعل."],
["Omar hasn't had breakfast yet, so his manager tells him to go and eat.","عمر لم يتناول فطوره بعد، فتطلب منه مديرته أن يذهب ليأكل."]],q:[
["What has the client just done?",["Called the bank","Signed the contract","Canceled the meeting","Sent an email"],1,"The client has just signed the contract."],
["How much of its target has the sales team reached?",["Fifty percent","Seventy percent","Ninety percent","All of it"],2,"reached ninety percent of its target."],
["What hasn't the system team done yet?",["Tested the update","Started the update","Come to work","Sent the contract"],0,"they haven't tested it yet."],
["What hasn't Omar done yet?",["Sent the copy","Told his manager","Met Mona","Had breakfast"],3,"Omar hasn't had breakfast yet."]]},
l3:{t:["Karim's Interview","مقابلة كريم"],p:[
["Karim has worked in retail banking for twelve years.","يعمل كريم في التجزئة المصرفية منذ اثني عشر عامًا."],
["He started as a sales officer in 2014 and became a team leader in 2018.","بدأ موظف مبيعات عام 2014 وأصبح قائد فريق عام 2018."],
["Since 2020, he has managed a team of fifteen people.","منذ عام 2020 يدير فريقًا من خمسة عشر شخصًا."],
["Last year, his team grew the loan portfolio by twenty-five percent.","في العام الماضي نمّى فريقه محفظة القروض بنسبة خمسة وعشرين بالمئة."],
["They trained the branch staff and followed up with every customer.","درّبوا موظفي الفروع وتابعوا كل عميل."],
["He has also worked with digital products.","وقد عمل أيضًا على منتجات رقمية."],
["Recently, he has finished a project for a mobile loan calculator.","مؤخرًا أنهى مشروع حاسبة قروض على الموبايل."],
["Today he has an interview at a bigger bank.","اليوم لديه مقابلة في بنك أكبر."],
["He has learned a lot in his job, but he is ready for a bigger challenge.","تعلّم الكثير في وظيفته، لكنه مستعد لتحدٍّ أكبر."]],q:[
["How long has Karim worked in retail banking?",["Four years","Twelve years","Fifteen years","Twenty-five years"],1,"for twelve years."],
["When did he become a team leader?",["In 2014","In 2020","In 2018","Last year"],2,"became a team leader in 2018."],
["By how much did his team grow the loan portfolio?",["Twenty-five percent","Twelve percent","Fifteen percent","Fifty percent"],0,"by twenty-five percent."],
["Why does he want a new job?",["He wants more holidays","He doesn't like his team","His bank is closing","He is ready for a bigger challenge"],3,"he is ready for a bigger challenge."]]},
d28:{t:["A Small Shop, a Big Dream","محل صغير وحلم كبير"],p:[
["Ten years ago, Samir opened a small phone shop because he loved technology.","منذ عشر سنوات افتتح سمير محل هواتف صغيرًا لأنه يحب التكنولوجيا."],
["At first, he had only a few customers, so he worked from morning until night.","في البداية كان له عملاء قليلون فقط، فكان يعمل من الصباح حتى الليل."],
["He was tired, but he didn't give up.","كان متعبًا، لكنه لم يستسلم."],
["Then he started to repair phones, and more people came.","ثم بدأ يصلح الهواتف، فجاء ناس أكثر."],
["After that, he needed more space, so he asked the bank for a small loan.","بعد ذلك احتاج مساحة أكبر، فطلب من البنك قرضًا صغيرًا."],
["Although the first bank refused, the second bank said yes.","مع أن البنك الأول رفض، وافق البنك الثاني."],
["When he got the loan, he moved to a bigger shop and hired two workers.","عندما حصل على القرض انتقل إلى محل أكبر ووظّف عاملين."],
["However, he still answers every customer himself.","ومع ذلك ما زال يردّ على كل عميل بنفسه."],
["Finally, last year he opened a second shop, and now he is planning a third one.","أخيرًا، افتتح العام الماضي محلًّا ثانيًا، وهو الآن يخطّط لثالث."]],q:[
["Why did Samir open a phone shop?",["His father had one","He loved technology","A friend asked him","He needed a job"],1,"because he loved technology."],
["What brought more people to his shop?",["Lower prices","A new sign","He started to repair phones","A bigger shop"],2,"he started to repair phones, and more people came."],
["What did the first bank do?",["It refused","It said yes","It gave him a big loan","It bought his shop"],0,"Although the first bank refused, the second bank said yes."],
["What happened last year?",["He closed his shop","He hired two workers","He got a loan","He opened a second shop"],3,"last year he opened a second shop."]]},
d29:{t:["Tarek's Study Plan","خطة طارق للمذاكرة"],p:[
["Tarek wants to improve his English because he needs to use it at work.","طارق يريد تحسين لغته الإنجليزية لأنه يحتاج استخدامها في العمل."],
["He hopes to reach level B1 by December.","يأمل أن يصل إلى مستوى B1 قبل ديسمبر."],
["He has decided to study for two hours every day.","قرّر أن يذاكر ساعتين كل يوم."],
["He enjoys listening to podcasts, so he plans to listen in the car every morning.","يستمتع بالاستماع إلى البودكاست، ولذلك يخطّط للاستماع في السيارة كل صباح."],
["He avoids speaking because he keeps making mistakes.","يتجنب التحدث لأنه يواصل ارتكاب الأخطاء."],
["His teacher wants him to stop worrying and start speaking.","معلّمته تريده أن يتوقف عن القلق ويبدأ التحدث."],
["She asked him to record his voice every day.","طلبت منه أن يسجّل صوته كل يوم."],
["Tarek doesn't mind recording, but he hates listening to himself.","طارق لا يمانع في التسجيل، لكنه يكره الاستماع إلى نفسه."],
["He has promised to try for one week, and he looks forward to seeing his progress.","وعد أن يحاول لمدة أسبوع، ويتطلع إلى رؤية تقدّمه."]],q:[
["Why does Tarek want to improve his English?",["For a holiday","He needs to use it at work","For his children","For an exam"],1,"because he needs to use it at work."],
["What level does he hope to reach by December?",["A2","C1","B1","B2"],2,"He hopes to reach level B1 by December."],
["What does he avoid?",["Speaking","Listening","Reading","Studying"],0,"He avoids speaking because he keeps making mistakes."],
["What did his teacher ask him to do every day?",["Write an email","Read a book","Watch a film","Record his voice"],3,"She asked him to record his voice every day."]]},
d30:{t:["Thirty Days Later","بعد ثلاثين يومًا"],p:[
["Thirty days ago, Karim decided to change his daily routine.","منذ ثلاثين يومًا قرّر كريم أن يغيّر روتينه اليومي."],
["Before that, he understood some English, but he couldn't speak confidently.","قبل ذلك كان يفهم بعض الإنجليزية، لكنه لم يكن يستطيع التحدث بثقة."],
["So he practiced for two hours every day: he listened in the car and studied after dinner.","فتدرّب ساعتين كل يوم: كان يستمع في السيارة ويذاكر بعد العشاء."],
["He has learned hundreds of new words, and he has reviewed thirty lessons.","تعلّم مئات الكلمات الجديدة، وراجع ثلاثين درسًا."],
["Now he is speaking more clearly, and he doesn't worry about mistakes.","الآن يتحدث بوضوح أكثر، ولا يقلق من الأخطاء."],
["Yesterday he wrote an email to a foreign client, and the client understood everything.","أمس كتب بريدًا إلى عميل أجنبي، وفهم العميل كل شيء."],
["Next month, he is going to start the B1 level.","الشهر القادم سيبدأ مستوى B1."],
["He will keep the same habit, because if he stops, he will forget.","سيحافظ على العادة نفسها، لأنه إذا توقف سينسى."],
["He believes that small steps make a big difference, and this is only the beginning.","يؤمن بأن الخطوات الصغيرة تصنع فرقًا كبيرًا، وهذه مجرد البداية."]],q:[
["What did Karim decide thirty days ago?",["To change his job","To change his daily routine","To travel abroad","To buy a car"],1,"Karim decided to change his daily routine."],
["How long did he practice every day?",["Thirty minutes","One hour","Two hours","Four hours"],2,"he practiced for two hours every day."],
["What did he do yesterday?",["He wrote an email to a foreign client","He took an exam","He gave a presentation","He met a tourist"],0,"Yesterday he wrote an email to a foreign client."],
["What is he going to do next month?",["Stop studying","Repeat the course","Take a holiday","Start the B1 level"],3,"he is going to start the B1 level."]]}
};
